      "skipped": "Mac Excel refuses =FREQUENCY({1;2;3}, {}) at entry: the formula written through formula2 reads back empty, so no formula is stored and Excel evaluates nothing. The empty array literal is rejected as a formula construct rather than treated as a degenerate bins argument. Formulon's parser rejects the empty array literal as well and returns #NAME?. Bins that hold no numeric value -- the 1x1 total-count spill -- are covered by tests/unit/eval/frequency_eval_test.cpp. Windows Excel 365 ja-JP 16.0.20326 refuses it at entry as well (COM 0x800A03EC, recorded as a driver skip in tests/oracle/targets/win-365-ja_JP/golden/), so no Excel host produces a value."
